  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox vevent\" style=\"font-size: 88%; line-height: 1.5em;\">\n\n<caption class=\"summary\" style=\"font-size: 125%; font-weight: bold\">United States presidential election, 2156\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/United_States\" title=\"United States\"><img alt=\"United States\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/d/de/Flag_of_the_United_States.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20170818144039\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Flag of the United States.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_the_United_States.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></span><hr />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\">\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:25%;text-align:left;\" class=\"noprint\"><a href=\"/wiki/United_States_presidential_election,_2152\" title=\"United States presidential election, 2152\">2152</a>&#160;←<br />\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%;text-align:center;\"><b>November 2, 2156</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:25%;text-align:right;\" class=\"noprint\">→&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/United_States_presidential_election,_2160\" title=\"United States presidential election, 2160\">2160</a><br />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\"><hr />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\"><small>All eligible voters who turned out</small><br /><small>51% of votes votes needed to win</small>\n</th></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Turnout\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center\">83.1%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/d/d2/Dom_Terragno_Blank.png/revision/latest?cb=20170209051940\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Dom Terragno Blank\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/d/d2/Dom_Terragno_Blank.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/121?cb=20170209051940\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"121\" height=\"147\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Dom Terragno Blank.png\" data-image-key=\"Dom_Terragno_Blank.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150810222433\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank Person\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/121?cb=20150810222433\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"121\" height=\"147\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Blank Person.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Person.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/40/Blank_Woman.png/revision/latest?cb=20151107015223\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank Woman\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"121\" height=\"147\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blank Woman.png\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Woman.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/40/Blank_Woman.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/121?cb=20151107015223\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Dom_Terragno\" title=\"Dom Terragno\">Dom Terragno</a></b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Dan Jagan\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Gabriela Scioli\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">New Progressive\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Conservative\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Liberacion\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Home&#160;state\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Earth\" title=\"Earth\">Ecuador</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Earth\" title=\"Earth\">Guyana</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Earth\" title=\"Earth\">Panama</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Running&#160;mate\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>Horace Fitzgerald</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Jord Teporis\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Nicolás Istúriz\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Popular&#160;vote\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>1,628,073,594</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">1,200,042,522\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">674,784,463\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Percentage\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>51.1%</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">31.3%\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">17.6%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\"><hr />\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left; text-size: 80%\"><b>President before election</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ha-eun_Zaya\" title=\"Ha-eun Zaya\">Ha-eun Zaya</a><br />\nUnion\n</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right; text-size: 80%\"><b>Elected President</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Dom_Terragno\" title=\"Dom Terragno\">Dom Terragno</a><br />\nNew Republican\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The <b>United States presidential election of 2156</b> was the 93rd quadrennial presidential election. <a href=\"/wiki/Dom_Terragno\" title=\"Dom Terragno\">Dom Terragno</a> won the election.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119205722\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.079 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.093 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2501/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 11894/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3942/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 14/100\nExpensive parser function count: 10/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1031396/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   74.431      1 Template:Infobox_election\n100.00%   74.431      1 -total\n 75.06%   55.868      3 Template:Infobox_election/row\n 30.09%   22.398     10 Template:Ifempty\n 10.19%    7.584      5 Template:Infobox_election/shortname\n  7.81%    5.813      1 Template:Flagicon\n  5.69%    4.237      1 Template:C